---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Service Information & Terms | Antons Blocked Drains" description="Information about bookings, drainage assessments, quotations, access and service availability for Antons Northern Beaches drain work." crumbs={[{name:'Service terms',href:'/terms'}]}>
  <div class="wrap intro-page"><h1>Service information.</h1></div><article class="wrap legal"><h2>Booking and attendance</h2><p>Calls are welcome 24/7. Attendance depends on the address, urgency, current availability, equipment and safe access. A website page or phone-link click does not confirm a booking or arrival time.</p><h2>Assessment and quotations</h2><p>Drainage advice on this site is general. Your property needs assessment before a particular method or result can be recommended. Initial charges and work scope should be discussed before approval. Additional repairs, reports and reinstatement should be agreed where required.</p><h2>Access and authority</h2><p>Tell the team about shared drainage, access restrictions, hazards and the person authorised to approve work. Offshore and restricted-access sites require specific arrangements.</p><h2>Method and outcome</h2><p>Camera visibility and equipment access have limits. Clearing an obstruction does not necessarily repair underlying pipe damage. Specific product warranties and workmanship terms should be provided with the relevant repair proposal; this website does not create a blanket repair guarantee.</p><h2>Questions about a service</h2><p>Contact the team on <a href={site.tel}>{site.phone}</a> to discuss the work, quotation or a concern. The contracting business and licence number appear in the footer.</p></article>
</Layout>
